    <tag k="inscription" v="Joseph Rowntree (1836-1925) Was born here over the Rowntree shop which opened on this site in 1822. A Quaker businessman, social reformer and philanthropist, he worked here until 1869 before leaving to run the famous Rowntree confectionery company."/>
